        "androidboot.vbmeta.device_state": "Development images are unlocked (android-image.md §6.2).",
        "androidboot.verifiedbootstate": "Development images are orange (android-image.md §6.2).",
        "androidboot.wifi_impl": "virt_wifi on eth2 instead of the capture's mac80211_hwsim_virtio, which needs crosvm's virtio Wi-Fi and the OpenWRT VM (android-image.md §7.4)."
      },
      "launcherCapture": "Images/reference/16373615/incomplete/default-20261001T120904-49816/internal-bootconfig.txt: the Cuttlefish 1.57.0 launcher's bootconfig for build 16373615 (IR-305). Every key above not listed under 'decided' has the capture's value.",
